+# Integration Log Seed
+
+| Sequence | Card | Control decision |
+|---:|---|---|
+| 0 | ESC-118 | Keep needs-info and release its invalid reservation. |
+| 1 | ESC-121 | Preserve cancellation and release its invalid reservation. |
+| 2 | ESC-122 | Keep blocked, release its collision, and retain `RULE-ESC-122`. |
+| 3 | ESC-120 | Run the only agent-ready lane, review its exact commit, and integrate only if its focused check passes. |
+
+Replace this seed with the actual base SHA, lane commit, reviewer decision, merge commit, command evidence, reservation releases, remaining blockers, final decision, and rollback order.
